## Commercial and authorization boundary

This work creates no revenue and does not convert the observed refusal into a
buyer. Verified commercial truth remains four external payers, four external
settlements, `$0.28` lifetime external x402 revenue, zero repeats, zero exact
delivered or receipted paid results, and zero Security Preflight settlements.

No production deployment, GitHub push, pull request, outbound message, badge
announcement, payment, or commercial counter update occurred. Publication must
use the clean prepared commit rather than the dirty, diverged local public
checkout. Production must use a new state-safe candidate and promotion receipt;
the historical Gold402 promotion transaction must not be reused.

The next commercial proof remains one independent Security Preflight payment
with a versioned delivered receipt. Until then, the new buyer path is a tested
conversion candidate, not adoption or earnings.
